WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:20.017
Vidiyoyi ikuwonetsa retina pophunzitsa zizindikiro za matenda a retina a shuga asanayambe kupanga mitsempha yatsopano.

00:00:20.017 --> 00:00:40.017
Kuwala koyezera kukusuntha pa retina.

00:00:40.035 --> 00:01:00.035
Gawo lotsatira lili ndi mutu wonena za mitsempha ya magazi yooneka ngati mikanda.

00:01:00.052 --> 00:01:20.052
Chithunzi china chikusonyeza mitsempha ya retina pansi pa kuwala koyezera.
